        "id": 165,
        "relationship_type": "related",
        "body": "かねない is a polite expression often used in business settings to indicate a possible undesirable outcome, as in 誤解を招きかねない (It might invite misunderstanding). 恐れがある also expresses possibility, but with a more objective focus on risk, as in 誤解を招く恐れがある (There’s a danger it will invite misunderstanding). The former feels more deferential, the latter more factual.",
        "first_relatable": {
